        "description": "Twarabiye hamwe ukuntu Isirayeli yahindutse umuzabibu utotahaye wama imbuto zawo. Twabonye ko abami n'abaherezi ataco bamariye abantu mu kubarongora ku Mana. Twabonye ko abantu bavuga amajambo y'amarogotano , amajambo atagira ikimazi, amajambo adafasha, amajambo atarongora abantu ku Mana. Ikindi twabonye nuko abantu bishimira itunga ryabo n'abahizi babo aho kwishimira Imana. Kubw'ivyo, twabonye ko urubanza ruzobashikako , Imana izobahana ibakure mu gihugu cabo ibarungike mu gihugu c'inyagano . Twabonye ko iyo umuntu abivye icaha y'imbura icaha , iyo ubivye ivy'impwemu wimbura ivy'impwemu nyene . Ab'Isirayeli rero babivye icaha bimbura igihano cabashitseko . Ariko naho twabonye ko Imana yahanye Ab'Isirayeli ntuyabahevye gose, twabonye ko izobagurukana mu gihugu kubw'urukundo rwayo.",
